# `**/` = at any depth (a bare pattern only matches at the context root)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.DS_Store
.git/
tests/
evals/
scripts/
**/*.md
!app/prompts/*.md
!app/prompts/**/*.md
# Documents for search_knowledge must be in the image
!app/knowledge/**
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Secrets and local state LAST, so no `!` rule above can re-include them
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.greennode.json
**/.greennode_runtime.json
**/.agentbase/
**/.agentbase-state.json
**/*.credentials.json
